==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} A [[motion picture]] that generates relatively low [[revenue]] at the [[box office]], especially that which is less than the budget for the motion picture.
#: ''My favorite movie was a giant '''box-office bomb.'''''

